### API 1: Send Message
POST http://localhost:3000/send-message
Content-Type: application/json
User-Agent: SMS Forwarder App

{
  "from": "Ashwin",
  "text": "Hello Ashwin latest!",
  "receivedStamp": 123456789,
  "sim": "SIM 2"
}

### API 2: Get All Messages (recent message of each User)
GET http://localhost:3000/messages/recent

### API 3: Get Sender's Message History
GET http://localhost:3000/messages/from/Ashwin

###API 4: Get Based on SIM
GET http://localhost:3000/messages/sim/SIM2



